# Marketplace settings

The marketplace is **desktop-owned code**: UI is the fork package `ui-settings-market` (settings section `market`, registers only when `window.shell` exposes the market API), engine is main-process `marketplace-catalog.js` / `marketplace-install.js` over `shell:*` IPC — the curated catalog is the single install path. `dshmarket` is `DROPPED` (not mounted, hidden from the catalog, install rejected; files stay on disk). Startup runs `removeDshMarketPreset` cleanup only (managed patch block, `desktop-plugins/dshmarket` copy, preset symlink) — never restore `ensureDshMarketPlugin`, extraResources packaging of dshmarket, or a standalone market BrowserWindow. `vendor/dshmarket` is a porting reference tree only (`DESKTOP-FORK.md`). Installs land in `dsh-home/profiles/web`; restart stays with HarnessController.

